Bank Customer Intelligence & Churn Analytics
Excel | PostgreSQL | Tableau

• Cleaned and transformed banking customer data using Excel.
• Performed exploratory and churn analysis using PostgreSQL.
• Developed 2 interactive Tableau dashboards with KPI tracking, customer segmentation, churn risk analysis, and credit score intelligence.
• Identified key churn drivers and provided actionable retention recommendations.

